        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="2945_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer:&lt;/strong&gt; B. By streamlining IT infrastructure management&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explanation:&lt;/strong&gt; AIOps use AI to manage IT infrastructure, ensuring robust, scalable, and reliable metaverse platforms. Option A is about AI-generated avatars. Option C pertains to digital twins. Option D is related to HCI.</mattext>
