&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B. Enabling decentralized transactions through smart contracts&lt;/strong&gt;: This is primarily a function of blockchain technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Try again?&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="3791_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;h3&gt;Explanation of Incorrect Answer&lt;/h3&gt;
