      <itemfeedback ident="7091_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;strong&gt;Correct Answer:&lt;/strong&gt; B. It supports decentralized applications (dapps) and direct user interactions&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Explanation:&lt;/strong&gt; Blockchain technology in the metaverse is crucial for enabling decentralized applications, ensuring users have control over their data and interactions. Option A is related to AI. Option C is related to HCI. Option D is a business application of AI within the metaverse.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
